                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "32ca1a22-1d00-312b-9540-5941009e1f50",
                        "entry_id": "47dacbf3-8f39-3f78-958e-c9e65fe597f0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "полигр. дефект типографского оттиска в виде следов краски на месте пробельного элемента изображения"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d63f6a1-d40e-4bfb-a2bf-ea56c6c3f6d2",
                                "sense_id": "32ca1a22-1d00-312b-9540-5941009e1f50",
                                "text": "Все эти правила графически вполне обоснованны: колонцифра на перечисленных полосах, расположенная там же, где и другие колонцифры издания, будут плавать в белом пространстве крупных пробелов и смотреться как неряшливая марашка."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fca2e017-e3d4-421b-ad60-995862c21b43",
                                "sense_id": "32ca1a22-1d00-312b-9540-5941009e1f50",
                                "text": "Для этого нужно было текст, где нужно, «посадить на шпоны» (вложить «пробельный материал» между набранными строками), а где нужно, «убрать шпоны», между слов где-то вложить незаметный дополнительный пробельный материал («шпации»); знать, что, если у наборщика в кассе не хватает какой-либо литеры, он ставит в набор любую литеру вверх ногами, а моё дело изобрести, как выйти из положения; если в набор попал случайно выскочивший из плоскости элемент пробельного материала или перевёрнутый лишний знак (что означает грязное пятно в тексте), надо специальным корректорским значком «осадить марашку»; надо уметь оценить размер подлежащей набору рукописи в типографских мерах длины и площади («квадратах», «линиях», «пунктах») и сократить её так, чтобы рукопись «влезла на полосу»; нужно следить за тем, чтобы края набора были выровнены; нужно знать существующие шрифты («прямой», «курсив», «полужирный» по характеру «очка», «нонпарель», «петит», «корпус», «цицеро», «шестнадцатый» по размеру литеры, «латинский», «академический» и другие ― по рисунку шрифта) и уметь «курсивить» и «убрать курсив», пометить «свой шрифт» и т. д. и т. п."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f2a6ad67-cdc3-4c71-ace0-3e48c1b1cde6",
                        "source_entry_id": "47dacbf3-8f39-3f78-958e-c9e65fe597f0",
                        "source_sense_id": "32ca1a22-1d00-312b-9540-5941009e1f50",
                        "target_lang_word": "slur",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "slur",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a16c8d23-3c5c-3252-881b-8e2bc0c382a7",
                                        "entry_id": "a9e32eb0-d24b-34c9-a8a5-6d5ac1480f7f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An insult or slight, especially one that is muttered incoherently under one's breath."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce975b42-21d3-4a4c-8a08-bc3927cd8201",
                                                "sense_id": "a16c8d23-3c5c-3252-881b-8e2bc0c382a7",
                                                "text": "It seems that according to their best guess, our mother's ^([sic]) drank too much coffee or alcohol, took drugs, or were under stress during the period of our conception. Underlying all this speculation is, of course, the big slur: we're some kind of unnatural or abnormal product, outside of humanity and their religions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c0c0540-3a49-38fe-9b04-b796714c1d72",
                                        "entry_id": "a9e32eb0-d24b-34c9-a8a5-6d5ac1480f7f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An insult or slight, especially one that is muttered incoherently under one's breath.",
                                            "An extremely offensive and socially unacceptable term targeted at a group of people (such as an ethnicity, sexual orientation, etc.)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ce89b9c-4dee-462f-8709-23fb7183d284",
                                                "sense_id": "2c0c0540-3a49-38fe-9b04-b796714c1d72",
                                                "text": "In interviews, current and former students of color described an environment rife with racial insensitivity, including casual uses of slurs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f121b01a-e06a-4a1a-80dc-5c2d5a7128d2",
                                                "sense_id": "2c0c0540-3a49-38fe-9b04-b796714c1d72",
                                                "text": "Elon Musk's recent declaration that the term \"cis\" is a slur indicates just how much transphobia is now central to Twitter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3dc0da7d-3fb7-3745-9927-679323dae628",
                                        "entry_id": "a9e32eb0-d24b-34c9-a8a5-6d5ac1480f7f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mark of dishonour; a blight or stain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0c8712f-8451-481c-afa7-941ecdfbad1f",
                                                "sense_id": "3dc0da7d-3fb7-3745-9927-679323dae628",
                                                "text": "a slur on one's reputation"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f8931c4-3ef6-4494-b588-989e44f32905",
                                                "sense_id": "3dc0da7d-3fb7-3745-9927-679323dae628",
                                                "text": "The undeserved slur which he had cast on my management of the household did not, I am happy to say, prevent me from returning good for evil to the best of my ability, by complying with his request as readily and respectfully as ever."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a21489e-afa9-405a-9a4a-44d45015c721",
                                                "sense_id": "3dc0da7d-3fb7-3745-9927-679323dae628",
                                                "text": "This was a reproach to John, and a slur upon the dog; and both were alive to their misfortune."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe4d8222-cd08-3d82-bea0-8be11888ab5f",
                                        "entry_id": "a9e32eb0-d24b-34c9-a8a5-6d5ac1480f7f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of running one's words together; poor verbal articulation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58ecf64e-6e1a-4371-ad72-6fe18916d66e",
                                                "sense_id": "fe4d8222-cd08-3d82-bea0-8be11888ab5f",
                                                "text": "And now I'm drinking too much, so I'ma talk with a slur"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d002c427-9d60-37b2-b935-a3b1804821f0",
                                        "entry_id": "a9e32eb0-d24b-34c9-a8a5-6d5ac1480f7f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any instance of separate things gradually blending together, such as heartbeats in some medical disorders."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d31542f8-6d48-3e0d-b599-bc268e37ff24",
                                        "entry_id": "a9e32eb0-d24b-34c9-a8a5-6d5ac1480f7f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A set of notes that are played legato, without separate articulation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "90c9a0bf-4c87-3234-aa03-80b527b96c66",
                                        "entry_id": "a9e32eb0-d24b-34c9-a8a5-6d5ac1480f7f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The symbol indicating a legato passage, written as an arc over the slurred notes (not to be confused with a tie)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "slur",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d24c51b-b7a5-327e-abfc-d4e083182218",
                                        "entry_id": "e92efc25-fd02-336d-ac8a-dc6e755c5159",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To insult or slight."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4609ed0-2212-4fe2-9808-975772beab0a",
                                                "sense_id": "2d24c51b-b7a5-327e-abfc-d4e083182218",
                                                "text": "And how men slur him, saying all his force / Is melted into mere effeminacy?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9eac287b-77a8-3998-b1c0-005b913f6cde",
                                        "entry_id": "e92efc25-fd02-336d-ac8a-dc6e755c5159",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To run together; to articulate poorly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5051c075-273f-4542-a176-e21e4db3343b",
                                                "sense_id": "9eac287b-77a8-3998-b1c0-005b913f6cde",
                                                "text": "to slur syllables;  He slurs his speech when he is drunk."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27e3ae3c-2ec2-42b1-8fc1-f73236b078fd",
                                                "sense_id": "9eac287b-77a8-3998-b1c0-005b913f6cde",
                                                "text": "\"Thank you for your donation,\" the girl says, slurring the words together into a single syllable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99b95d44-3546-4749-b19a-66a63735c979",
                                                "sense_id": "9eac287b-77a8-3998-b1c0-005b913f6cde",
                                                "text": "Manganism has been known about since the 19th century, when miners exposed to ores containing manganese, a silvery metal, began to totter, slur their speech and behave like someone inebriated."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa7ec0ae-9143-3e28-8a53-0870f8c09045",
                                        "entry_id": "e92efc25-fd02-336d-ac8a-dc6e755c5159",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To play legato or without separate articulation; to connect (notes) smoothly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1dd09cd-7355-41b6-b587-1732965042f4",
                                                "sense_id": "aa7ec0ae-9143-3e28-8a53-0870f8c09045",
                                                "text": "Notes , the stems of which are joined together by cross lines, as in united quavers , semiquavers , & c . or notes over the heads of which a curve is drawn, to signify that they are to be slurred"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3be01670-aafc-37f8-84f1-2b4445f6a3b3",
                                        "entry_id": "e92efc25-fd02-336d-ac8a-dc6e755c5159",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To soil; to sully; to contaminate; to disgrace."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2ac9dd1-6d79-43e4-b28f-d3b5f2eb683b",
                                                "sense_id": "3be01670-aafc-37f8-84f1-2b4445f6a3b3",
                                                "text": "they do not only impudently slur the gospel, according to the history and the letter, in making it no better than a romantical legend[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7dd2de02-654b-3c86-addf-3be6eaa5dcd2",
                                        "entry_id": "e92efc25-fd02-336d-ac8a-dc6e755c5159",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cover over; to disguise; to conceal; to pass over lightly or with little notice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "470ba5a1-a53f-449e-ab81-95429acaf4ae",
                                                "sense_id": "7dd2de02-654b-3c86-addf-3be6eaa5dcd2",
                                                "text": "With periods, points, and tropes, he slurs his crimes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "677401a6-4661-31c9-989a-230d5b2ac0bd",
                                        "entry_id": "e92efc25-fd02-336d-ac8a-dc6e755c5159",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cheat, as by sliding a die; to trick."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb430b8d-66a3-4409-a649-19027d816a43",
                                                "sense_id": "677401a6-4661-31c9-989a-230d5b2ac0bd",
                                                "text": "to slur men of what they fought for"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bba0d83e-1f23-3a1d-9344-3d1bd3ad624a",
                                        "entry_id": "e92efc25-fd02-336d-ac8a-dc6e755c5159",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To blur or double, as an impression from type; to mackle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
